livesmatter? Please respond with a dollar figure, thanks!","userId":50157194,"media":null,"username":"dcmarla","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":4.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":50,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":90,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":4.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1267996753082454017","date":1591148958000,"rawContent":"You know what? It's always a good day to ditch a confederate statue! Thanks to my brother, Mayor @justindotnet, for his steadfast leadership on this. #blacklivesmatter","userId":50157194,"media":null,"username":"dcmarla","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":5.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":51,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":90,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":5.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1268969259796803584","date":1591380822000,"rawContent":"Check this thread. We really can't be deceived by symbolic gestures right now, especially when @MayorBowser's  proposed budget boosts police funding and decreases funding for non-police public safety interventions. #blacklivesmatter #dcprotest","userId":50157194,"media":null,"username":"dcmarla","containsBlackLivesMatter":true,"containsBlueLivesMatter":false,"containsMeToo":false,"containsClimate":false,"rollingTweetsPerMonth":6.0,"sumOfBlackLivesMatter":52,"sumOfBlueLivesMatter":0,"sumOfMeToo":6,"sumOfClimate":90,"rollingSumOfBlackLivesMatter":6.0,"rollingSumOfBlueLivesMatter":0.0,"rollingSumOfMeToo":0.0,"rollingSumOfClimate":0.0},{"id":"1271712168304472065","date":1592034782000,"rawContent":"So\u2026cops that serve *schools* and work with children had *grenade launchers* as recently as 2014??? #BlackLivesMatter","userId":50157194,"media":null